<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Parexel started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Parexel started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it started coverage of Parexel International Corp with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- Said expects 30 percent annual revenue growth and 35 percent annual earnings per share growth.</p>
<p>-- Set 12-month price per share target in mid-50's.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/4 to 48-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
